From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Myria Sarvay <myrialsarvay@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:39:47 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] drivers/perf: apple_m1: Add Apple M4 Series Support

Add support for the CPU PMU found in the various M4 SoCs. This PMU is
almost exactly the same as the M3 PMU, just with different event
encodings.

Signed-off-by: Myria Sarvay <myrialsarvay@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/perf/apple_m1_cpu_pmu.c | 209 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 209 insertions(+)

